 "body": "<div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"admin-root\"><a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\" target=\"_self\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Skip to content</span></a><nav aria-label=\"Admin\" class=\"con-nav\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"nav\" data-bl-label=\"Admin\"><ul class=\"list list--plain con-nav__bar\"><li><a href=\"/admin\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Admin</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/admin/lifecycle\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Lifecycle</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/admin/audit\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Audit</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/admin/jobs\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Jobs</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/admin#view-as\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">View as role</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/admin/guests#inspect-guest\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Inspect a guest</span></a></li></ul><details><summary><span data-bl-t=\"label\">All admin screens</span></summary><div class=\"con-index\"><section aria-labelledby=\"nav-site\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"The site\"><p id=\"nav-site\" class=\"con-index__label\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">The site</span></p><ul class=\"list list--plain con-index__list\"><li><a href=\"/admin/lifecycle\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Lifecycle</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">What state guests see, what the calendar suggests, and previewing another state.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/flags\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Feature flags</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Both halves of every gate, and the two legal switches that stay shut.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/content\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Content</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Records with provenance, freshness and verification.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/events\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Events &amp; RSVP window</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Events, meal options, notices, and when RSVP opens.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/sitemap\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Sitemap</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Every endpoint the app serves, and what each one should answer.</span></span></li></ul></section><section aria-labelledby=\"nav-guests\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Guests\"><p id=\"nav-guests\" class=\"con-index__label\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Guests</span></p><ul class=\"list list--plain con-index__list\"><li><a href=\"/admin/guests\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Guests</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">People, households they belong to, identity resets.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/households\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Households</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Household records and mailing addresses.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/invitations\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Invitations</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Issue, rotate and revoke invitation links.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/rsvp\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">RSVPs</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Who has replied, overrides and exports.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/seating\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Seating</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Tables, assignments and publishing the chart.</span></span></li></ul></section><section aria-labelledby=\"nav-weekend\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"The weekend\"><p id=\"nav-weekend\" class=\"con-index__label\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">The weekend</span></p><ul class=\"list list--plain con-index__list\"><li><a href=\"/admin/travel\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Travel &amp; stay</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Hotels, links and the room block.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/transport\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Transport</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Benefit entitlements and voucher codes.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/gifts\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Gifts</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Registry and gift links.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/reservations\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Reservations</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Venues guests can book through.</span></span></li></ul></section><section aria-labelledby=\"nav-media\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Media &amp; AI\"><p id=\"nav-media\" class=\"con-index__label\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Media &amp; AI</span></p><ul class=\"list list--plain con-index__list\"><li><a href=\"/admin/media\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Media</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Moderation queue, imports and duplicates.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/ai\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Media AI</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Captions, indexing and what the model may touch.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/concierge\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Concierge</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Answer traces, grounding failures, security alerts.</span></span></li></ul></section><section aria-labelledby=\"nav-operations\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Operations\"><p id=\"nav-operations\" class=\"con-index__label\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Operations</span></p><ul class=\"list list--plain con-index__list\"><li><a href=\"/admin/audit\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Audit trail</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Every action anyone took, searchable, redacted.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/jobs\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Jobs</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Queue depth, failures and retries.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/metrics\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Metrics</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">What this deployment recorded, and whether it is recording.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/providers\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Providers</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Which adapter each integration resolved to, and what it can do.</span></span></li></ul></section></div></details></nav><main id=\"main\" class=\"ops\" data-bl-k=\"main\" data-bl-label=\"Search index\"><nav aria-label=\"Media and AI\" class=\"con-subnav\" data-bl-k=\"nav\" data-bl-label=\"Media and AI\"><ul class=\"list list--plain\"><li><a aria-current=\"page\" href=\"/admin/ai\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Search index</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/admin/concierge\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Concierge</span></a></li></ul></nav><div class=\"con-head\"><div><h1 class=\"ops-title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Search index</span></h1><p class=\"ops-lede\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">What the archive can be searched by, where each description came from, and what is waiting for a person to approve.</span></p></div></div><section id=\"coverage\" class=\"ops-section\" aria-labelledby=\"coverage-heading\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Coverage\"><h2 id=\"coverage-heading\" class=\"ops-h2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Coverage</span></h2><p class=\"con-note\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">No index run yet.</span></p><div class=\"con-stats\" data-bl-b=\"\"><div class=\"con-stat\"><span class=\"con-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">0</span></span><span class=\"con-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Indexable items</span></span></div><div class=\"con-stat\"><span class=\"con-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">0</span></span><span class=\"con-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Indexed</span></span></div><div class=\"con-stat\"><span class=\"con-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">0</span></span><span class=\"con-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Machine suggestions</span></span></div><div class=\"con-stat\"><span class=\"con-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">0</span></span><span class=\"con-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Waiting for review</span></span></div></div><dl class=\"con-kv\"><div><dt><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Indexed from metadata only</span></dt><dd><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">0</span></dd></div><div><dt><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Skipped: professional media without written confirmation</span></dt><dd><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">0</span></dd></div><div><dt><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Bursts / near-duplicates / exact duplicates</span></dt><dd><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">0 / 0 / 0</span></dd></div><div><dt><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Index jobs queued / running / dead</span></dt><dd><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">0 / 0 / 0</span></dd></div></dl></section><section id=\"switches\" class=\"ops-section\" aria-labelledby=\"switches-heading\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"What is switched on\"><h2 id=\"switches-heading\" class=\"ops-h2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What is switched on</span></h2><dl class=\"con-kv\"><div><dt><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Semantic search</span></dt><dd><span class=\"con-pill con-pill--good\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">On</span></span></dd></div><div><dt><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Third-party processing of photographers’ media</span></dt><dd><span class=\"con-pill con-pill--neutral\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Off</span></span></dd></div></dl><p class=\"con-note\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Photographers’ media needs the flag and its readiness switch on, and each vendor’s written confirmation on their own files.</span></p></section><section id=\"review\" class=\"ops-section\" aria-labelledby=\"review-heading\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Waiting for review (0)\"><h2 id=\"review-heading\" class=\"ops-h2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Waiting for review (0)</span></h2><p class=\"con-note\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Suggested alt text is a draft. Publish it as written only when it is already right; otherwise edit it into your own words. Nothing here reaches a guest until you do.</span></p><p tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"am-notice\" role=\"status\"></p><p class=\"flow-empty\" role=\"status\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">No suggestions are waiting. New uploads are described after the next index run.</span></p></section><details class=\"flow-details\" data-bl-b=\"\"><summary><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Technical details</span></summary><div class=\"flow-details__body\"><dl class=\"con-kv\"><div><dt><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Descriptions</span></dt><dd><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">mock (mock)</span></dd></div><div><dt><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Embeddings</span></dt><dd><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">mock-hash-256, 256 dimensions (mock)</span></dd></div><div><dt><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Index</span></dt><dd><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">pgvector, persistent</span></dd></div><div><dt><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Photographers’ media flag</span></dt><dd><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">off</span></dd></div><div><dt><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Readiness switch</span></dt><dd><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">off</span></dd></div></dl></div></details></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div>"
